fsot-grebennikov-cse-levitation
Copyright 2026 Damian Arthur Palumbo

This product is an FSOT 2.0 simulation and research study of Grebennikov's
Cavity Structure Effect (beetle elytra microstructures) toward a
levitation platform.
This repository is part of the FSOT (Fluid Spacetime Omni-Theory) family.
Theory authority is vendor/fsot_compute.py in
https://github.com/dappalumbo91/FSOT-2.1-Lean (pin AEB2AD), also by
Damian Arthur Palumbo and licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

Python dependencies (not bundled, see requirements.txt): mpmath (BSD-3-Clause),
NumPy (BSD-3-Clause) and Matplotlib (Matplotlib/PSF-style license).
